<problem>

<setup>
<selectFromSequence name="a" from="1" to="10" />
<selectFromSequence name="b" from="2" to="5" />
<selectFromSequence name="c" from="1" to="8" />
<math name="ans" simplify="full">$a*$b**3+($b**2+$b+1)*$c</math>
<math name="ans_sub1" simplify="full">$b*$a+$c</math>
<math name="ans_sub2" simplify="full">$b*$ans_sub1+$c</math>
</setup>

Compute the value of <m>f(f(f($a)))</m> for the function <m>f(x)=$b x+$c</m>.

<p><m>f(f(f($a))) =</m> <mathInput name="input1" /></p>

<answer>
<award symbolicEquality="true" referencesAreResponses="$input1"><when>
  $input1 = $ans
</when></award>
</answer>


<solution>
<md>
  <mrow>f(f(f($a)))\amp = f(f($b \cdot $a+$c))</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = f(f($ans_sub1))</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = f($b \cdot $ans_sub1 + $c)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = f($ans_sub2)</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = $b \cdot $ans_sub2 + $c</mrow>
  <mrow>\amp = $ans</mrow>
</md>
</solution>

</problem>